                    "value": "Cash position (Chris, Oct 22) = billings to date - retainage receivable - unpaid receivables, less (costs incurred - unpaid payables - retainage payable). Billings: Procore owner pay apps (gross). Retainage: Procore pay apps and requisitions. Unpaid AR and AP: Sage, voids excluded. Costs incurred: Procore job-to-date cost. A project with no Procore budget has no cash position and is left out (Data Health: budget forecast).",
